                <mxCell id="63" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;Return:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. It started during the requested window&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; - The speed’s `DateStarted` is on or after `startDate` and on or before `endDate`.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; - In words: “Give me speeds that began within the window.”&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;2. It ended during the requested window&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; - The speed’s `DateEnded` is on or after `startDate` and on or before `endDate`.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; - In words: “Give me speeds that finished within the window.”&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;3. It started before (or at) the start of the window and is still active&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; - The speed’s `DateStarted` is on or before `startDate` and `DateEnded` is null (meaning “no end yet”).&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; - In words: “Give me the speed that was already running when the window began and hasn’t ended yet.”&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=process;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
